<title>USA: Bowater to redeem LIBOR pfd series A shrs.</title>
<headline>Bowater to redeem LIBOR pfd series A shrs.</headline>
<dateline>GREENVILLE, S.C. 1997-04-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bowater Inc said it will redeem all of the 500,000 outstanding shares of its LIBOR Preferred Stock, Series A, for cash effective May 12, 1997, before the mandatory redemption date of January 15, 1998.</p>
<p>The company will redeem the preferred stock at its par value of $50 per share, plus accrued and unpaid dividends.</p>
<p>Bowater Inc produces newsprint and makes coated and uncoated groundwood papers, bleached kraft pulp and lumber products.</p>
</text>
